$ STRUDL SIMPLE TRUSS ANALYSIS
  TYPE PLANE TRUSS
  UNITS KIPS FEET
  JOINT COORD
    1     0.0   0.0
    2    10.0   0.0
    3     5.0   8.66
  SUPPORTS
    1  PINNED
    2  ROLLER X
  MEMBER INC
    1  1  2
    2  2  3
    3  1  3
  MEMBER PROP
    1 TO 3  PRIS AX 2.0  E 29000.0
  LOADING 1 'APPLIED LOADS'
    JOINT LOAD
      3  FORCE Y  -20.0
  STIFFNESS ANAL
  PRINT JOINT DISP
  PRINT MEMBER FORCES
  FINISH
